================================================================================
               PART 2: PRE-COMPILED SHARED RUNTIMES                             
================================================================================
The following binary runtimes are embedded for automated cross-platform 
distribution and runtime execution setup.

1. FFmpeg (ffmpeg/win32/ and ffmpeg/win64/)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
* License     : LGPL v3.0 (Shared / Dynamic linking build)
* Homepage    : https://ffmpeg.org
* Compliance  : In strict accordance with the LGPL requirements, FFmpeg is
                integrated via DYNAMIC LINKING ONLY (external .dll files).
                The user retains the right to swap out these shared libraries.
                Consequently, the core suite executable code remains unlinked
                statically and fully protected under its native MIT License.
                Original license and README documents are preserved within
                their respective architecture directories.


